<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How sweet the living water from the hills of God,</l><l>It’s flowing in and flowing out of me;</l><l>O now I’ve found the place for which I long had sought,</l><l>Where there is life and life abundantly.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O brother, won’t you gather in the local church?</l><l>A fountain here is flowing deep and wide.</l><l>The Shepherd now would bring you to the local church,</l><l>Where thirsty spirits can be satisfied.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
